  "calibrationNotes": "The hire cart (GOLF-ART-LIST item 173: 1.2 x 2.4 m). SE and SW headings: the game's own golf-cart-se and golf-cart-sw, reused (their atlas cells). The other six: the lead's two sheets (F:/Art/newArt/animations/buildings/business~golf-cart/{corners,axisturn}.png) keyed and cleaned (scripts/assets/golf-cart/prep_cart.py), at 1.059 library px per native px = the existing pictures' 1.4063 x 0.753 (the roof's horizontal width, which does not depend on the camera's pitch: measure.py), drawn at the existing cart's owner size 0.294. Anchors: the roof's centroid and the old pictures' roof-to-floor drop at that scale (measure.py). The corners sheet's bottom row is not used (drawn from a camera 9 degrees higher than every other picture).",
